imultaneously attacks the rook on h8. After the king moves (likely Kd7 or Ke7), I capture the rook with Nxh8, winning significant material (a rook is worth about 5 points). This is a tactical blow that gives White a decisive advantage.\n\nAnswer: N: g5-f7'}
