uares\n- After the king moves (likely Kf6 or Kf7), I can continue applying pressure with my well-placed Queen and Bishop\n- This forcing move maintains the initiative and keeps Black on the defensive\n- It could lead to a quick tactical win given Black's exposed king position\n\nAnswer: Q: d8-h8"}
