ason: R: e7-e8 delivers check to the Black King on f8, forcing it to move (likely to g7). This move dominates the back rank and severely restricts Black's king mobility. After the King moves, I'll have excellent winning chances with my Rook controlling the 8th rank and being able to coordinate with my other pieces for a mating attack. This is the most forcing and strongest continuation.\n\nAnswer: R: e7-e8"}
