st move.\n\nReason: Capturing the Black bishop on h7 with my rook eliminates Black's last piece besides pawns and the king. With such a massive material advantage (Rook + Bishop + extra pawns), the win becomes trivial - I can systematically advance my pawns while using my pieces to support them and stop Black's pawns. This is the most forcing and clearest path to victory.\n\nAnswer: R: e7-h7"}
