awn, which cannot be defended\n- Black must either lose the g4 pawn or push it to g3, where it becomes weaker\n- Opens up my kingside and improves my pawn structure\n- This tactical gain will simplify the position to my advantage\n\nAnswer: P: h2-h3"}
