ng. I need to deal with it immediately.\n\nReason: The h3 pawn is Black's most dangerous piece, being just two moves from queening (h3-h2-h1=Q). Moving my King to h2 directly attacks and will capture this pawn, eliminating the main threat. This is the most forcing and practical solution to neutralize Black's immediate winning chances.\n\nAnswer: K: g1-h2"}
