learly the strongest move because:\n- It immediately blockades the dangerous h3 pawn\n- It keeps the Black king trapped on the back rank\n- It gives White time to consolidate and push for checkmate\n- With the overwhelming material advantage, preventing Black's only counterplay (pawn promotion) secures the win\n\nAnswer: R: b1-h1"}
