mplish multiple objectives:\n- It severely restricts Black's king to the corner (h7)\n- It controls the critical f8 and h8 squares, preventing the king from escaping\n- It maintains pressure while keeping my bishop active and well-placed\n- Combined with my rook and king, I can create a mating net\n- This positional dominance will allow me to deal with Black's pawns while maintaining winning chances\n\nThis move puts maximum pressure on Black's position and creates the best winning chances by restricting their most important piece.\n\nAnswer: B: f6-g7"}
