roves my Rook's position. In King and Rook vs King and Pawns endgames, eliminating advanced passed pawns is crucial. After this capture, I can focus on stopping the remaining pawns (b3, a5, h3) with my Rook's mobility and King support.\n\nAnswer: R: d1-d3"}
