, forcing Black's king to remain passive while threatening immediate promotion. This is a classic pawn endgame principle: push the passed pawn that's closest to promotion. Black cannot stop this pawn from promoting, which will give me a decisive material advantage.\n\nAnswer: P: f6-f7"}
