 Queen is the obvious best move. It gives me overwhelming material advantage (Queen is worth about 9 points vs a pawn worth 1 point). With a Queen, I can quickly stop Black's pawn, control the board, and deliver checkmate efficiently. There is no reason to choose a weaker piece or delay promotion.\n\nAnswer: P: a7-a8-q"}
