ate threat of the b4 pawn promoting. From d3, my king controls c2 (blocking the pawn's path) and can capture on b3 if the pawn advances. This move gives me the best practical chances to stop the pawn and win the resulting King vs King endgame.\n\nAnswer: K: e4-d3"}
